# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit the real key.
#
# This file is for LOCAL DEV ONLY, so it holds exactly one key. The SDK reads a
# single variable (ANTHROPIC_API_KEY); what changes per environment is which key
# gets injected into it:
#
#   laptop  (npm run dev)      -> pipeline-radar-ci    <- this file
#   CI      (GitHub Actions)   -> pipeline-radar-ci    <- gh secret ANTHROPIC_API_KEY_CI
#   prod    (ECS Fargate)      -> pipeline-radar-prod  <- AWS Secrets Manager
#
# The prod key never lands on a laptop: the Fargate task reads it straight from
# Secrets Manager at start, so there is nothing here for it to hold. The two keys
# live in separate Anthropic workspaces with separate spend caps, so a runaway
# locally or in CI cannot starve the deployed demo.
# See MILESTONE-6-PLAN.md §6.3 "Layer 0".
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
